  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **HERETIC ASTARTES** as your Army Faction, whenever a unit of yours that has this rule is chosen to shoot or to fight, you may have it make a Dark Pact:\n\n1. Before anything from the pact resolves, the unit takes a Leadership test; if that test fails, the unit takes D3 mortal wounds.\n2. Pick **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** or **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**; the unit's weapons have the chosen ability until the phase ends.",
